{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"パシフィコ横浜で個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブの感想\nたくさんありがとうございました！\nもっともっと頑張ろうって思えた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/06/8814053/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部 ゆる巻ツイン\n3部 ちょんまげみたいなやつ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/06/8814053/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックシャツ\nused(Inpaichthys kerri)\nTシャツ RNA-N\nデニムショーパン used\n靴 GAIMO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"田舎、\n虫取り網を持って走りたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部 うしろでくるんとまとめたお団子\n5部 ゆる巻ポニー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/06/8814053/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オールインワン ZURI"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうオールインワンとか\nつなぎがだいすきなの〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で何度も\nこの柄乃木坂じゃん\nってつっこまれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あ！\nたしかに...(遅)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも意識したわけじゃなくて(恥)\nそうなの、そんなつもりじゃ(恥)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を繰り返したな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もともと紫色は好きだから...\nかわいいからいーのよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵のリクエストが多く、\nとても嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙を担当させていただいた\n熊坂監督の小説が\n中盤に入りました。\nぜひ読んでください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更ながらですが、\nリクエストがあった\n表紙の原画を載せる！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/06/8814053/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今描いてる絵、\n完成したら載せるね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9thシングルの発売日\n握手会で発表されたね！\n7月9日！夏！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ、もう夏か〜\nガルルが懐かしいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/05/06/8814053/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕も飛ぶんだ...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}